# Code owners for symaira-cockpit.
#
# GitHub matches the LAST matching pattern, so the broad fallback comes first
# and the narrower, higher-risk paths override it below.
#
# The ruleset deliberately does NOT require code-owner review: this is a
# single-maintainer repository, and GitHub does not count the author's own
# approval, so requiring it would block every PR. This file documents
# ownership and routes review requests; it becomes load-bearing as soon as a
# second maintainer exists.

*                                                   @danieljustus

